- 5: critical
- 4: high
- 3: medium
- 2: low
- 1: informational', example='1'),
  alertLevelMapping?: string(name='AlertLevelMapping', description='The alert level mapping.', example='high'),
  alertName?: string(name='AlertName', description='The name of the alert. You can use $$ to reference query output fields.', example='Detected high-frequency multi-type network attacks from $src_ip$'),
  alertSchemaId?: string(name='AlertSchemaId', description='The ID of the alert template for the detection rule. Valid values:
- ALERT_ACTIVITY: other alerts
- EDR_ALERT_ACTIVITY: endpoint detection and response (EDR) alerts
- FIREWALL_ALERT_ACTIVITY: firewall alerts
- WAF_ALERT_ACTIVITY: Web Application Firewall (WAF) alerts', example='ALERT_ACTIVITY'),
  alertTacticId?: string(name='AlertTacticId', description='The tactic phase of the alert.', example='TA0042'),
  alertThresholdCount?: int32(name='AlertThresholdCount', description='The alert threshold count.', example='10'),
  alertThresholdGroup?: string(name='AlertThresholdGroup', description='The list of alert threshold fields, separated by commas.', example='alert_type,ip'),
  alertThresholdPeriod?: string(name='AlertThresholdPeriod', description='The length of the alert threshold period.', example='5m'),
  alertType?: string(name='AlertType', description='The alerting type.', example='WebShell'),
  alertTypeMapping?: string(name='AlertTypeMapping', description='The alerting type mapping.', example='benign_type_mapping'),
  detectionExpressionContent?: string(name='DetectionExpressionContent', description='The expression content of the detection rule.', example='*|set session mode=scan;SELECT * FROM log
